1
00:00:00,902 --> 00:00:02,502
(Penny:)You taught him well, Padawan.

2
00:00:02,670 --> 00:00:07,120
Good Lord! Padawan's the student,
not the teacher.

3
00:00:09,010 --> 00:00:10,680
(Penny:)Seriously, let him go.

4
00:00:17,185 --> 00:00:19,855
(Leonard:)Sheldon, if you really need to
do this, I won't stand in your way.

5
00:00:21,189 --> 00:00:22,189
(Sheldon:)I do.

6
00:00:23,525 --> 00:00:26,365
(Leonard:)Okay. Good luck.

7
00:00:30,932 --> 00:00:32,712
(Penny:)Be safe and call us.

8
00:00:35,970 --> 00:00:37,040
(Sheldon:)I will.

9
00:00:39,507 --> 00:00:40,507
(Leonard:)Bye, buddy.

10
00:00:45,813 --> 00:00:48,123
(Mrs Hofstadter:)-Sheldon...
-Yes?

11
00:00:49,550 --> 00:00:50,650
(Leonard:)I'm gonna miss you.

12
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:54,200
(Sheldon:)Of course you are.

13
00:00:56,791 --> 00:01:06,021
(Leonard:)He just made that easier.

